@base = http://127.0.0.1:8083

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Initial summary
GET {{base}}/api/inventory/summary
### Create
# @name createReservation
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestKey":"manual-001","customerRef":"team-a","items":[{"sku":"BOLT-M8","quantity":3},{"sku":"NUT-M8","quantity":2}]}
### Replay same request
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestKey":"manual-001","customerRef":"team-a","items":[{"sku":"BOLT-M8","quantity":3},{"sku":"NUT-M8","quantity":2}]}
### Read returned ID
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/{{createReservation.response.body.$.id}}
### Cancel
POST {{base}}/api/reservations/{{createReservation.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
### Summary
GET {{base}}/api/inventory/summary
### Missing row
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/9999
